    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "those are good, but they feel very focused on how we treat others and the community. what about virtues that are more about the individual? like personal responsibility or something? do you think those are still important in a democracy, or are they kind of outdated in this modern context?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
